# Smart Robotic Wheelchair Management System

## Complete Project Setup Guide for the Developer

**Version:** MVP v1.0

**Tech Stack**

- React Native (Expo) - Mobile App
- React (Vite) - Web Dashboard
- Firebase
  - Authentication
  - Firestore
  - Storage
  - Cloud Messaging (Future)

- GitHub
- VS Code

---

# 1. Project Overview

The system consists of three modules:

## Mobile App

### Patient

- Login
- Request wheelchair
- Track wheelchair
- View history

### Caregiver

- Login
- Add patients
- Add wheelchairs
- Manage patients

---

## Web Dashboard

### Admin

- Dashboard

- Patient Management

- Wheelchair Management

- Reports

- Analytics

---

## Robot

- Listen for requests

- Navigate

- Update status

---

